The code in this folder is from Mutable Instruments' open-source Eurorack firmware
(https://github.com/pichenettes/eurorack, commit f4cfa7697095a28d292bff758beb51deb49b5a86)
and stmlib (https://github.com/pichenettes/stmlib), by Emilie Gillet.
One change: plaits/user_data.h includes <cstdio>, so it builds outside the original project.

